                    <div class="column-div" style="width: 20%; text-align: center;"><strong>Force Majeure</strong></div>
                    <div class="column-div" style="width: 30%;">Any circumstance considered to be beyond the reasonable control of a Party and which results in the impossibility of fulfilling the Party’s obligations, including (by way of example but not limited to):
                        <p>a) natural events - flood, earthquake, landslide or other natural disaster, epidemic or pandemic;</p>
                        <p>b) terrorist acts, civil war, civil unrest, war, threat of war, armed conflict, imposition of sanctions, embargo, closure of borders;</p>
                        <p>c) nuclear, chemical, or biological contamination;</p>
                        <p>d) collapse of buildings, fire, explosion, or other similar accidents;</p>
                        <p>e) any labor or industrial disputes, strikes, or lockouts.</p>
